{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：13:00 2026-09-03 HKT</p>\n\n<p>TVB視帝陳展鵬近日在風水命理節目《玄戰》擔任出題嘉賓，在節目中罕有公開隱藏多年的重大秘密，他向在場參賽者問道：「2021年發生咗一件事，呢件事對於我人生嚟講係好大嘅挑戰，究竟係發生咗咩事？同埋呢件事處理好未？」隨後他親自揭開這宗涉及「八位數字」的合約糾紛。陳展鵬透露，在2019至2020年間曾接下一份高達逾千萬元酬勞的代言宣傳合約，但隨後全球爆發疫情，宣傳活動大受影響，令他未能完整履行合約條款。</p>\n<h2>陳展鵬硬捱5年賠償客戶</h2>\n<p>雖然合約並無註明需作任何賠償，但陳展鵬在法理之外選擇恪守道義，不願客戶蒙受損失，毅然決定將已收取的巨額酬金中的三分之二退還給對方。然而當時他面臨極大兩難，因該筆酬金已第一時間用作置業、買下人生首個物業送給母親以盡孝心。為兼顧孝道與誠信，他主動向客戶協商分5年慢慢還清款項。背負長達5年的沉重還款壓力，陳展鵬在節目中宣布如今已全數還清八位數款項，事件終圓滿解決，令全場嘉賓與參賽者深感佩服。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬與單文柔早前帶同囡囡搬到複式獨立屋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92c015b4782c35a4b8817c5e980b94dd/2024-04/Screenshot_20240421_192920_com_instagram_android.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬坐在樓梯間。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f3e8ade9e365e44528aab8f300a0299/2026-05/raco_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔多度在IG分享豪宅照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/497264271b461992c809882646d8cd44/2026-05/raco_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬近日現身《玄戰》擔任出題嘉賓，談及2021年的人生重大挑戰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b5f3578ab370350734ed4cfbe34d5c08/2026-09/VS--1--myTVSUPER-14_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬親述當年因疫情衝擊導致代言宣傳受阻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38948532746328ed3bf4ca4bf7a0ba70/2026-09/VS--1--myTVSUPER-19_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"參賽者專注聆聽陳展鵬揭秘接下巨額代言酬金的始末。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/baa2b14c5124287e72a2100d910d2b5a/2026-09/VS--1--myTVSUPER-19_56_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬透露早已將酬金用作置業買樓孝敬母親。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d2ade07b2146d1a2a8b3a896a24b8ca5/2026-09/VS--1--myTVSUPER-19_31__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬主動與客戶協商，承諾分5年退還款項。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0901dd3208c5e891209c0e2c307409fe/2026-09/VS--1--myTVSUPER-20_02_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬的太太單文柔早前曝光女兒的睡房。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e0180c1c21274c169ea3fa564a80e36/2026-06/RUCO_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔公開女兒的睡房，見到布置簡潔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1fc89eecab9ce5f116a4b7576f78169e/2026-06/RUCO_9_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬囡囡的房間只有一張書枱及凳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/016d81b0afe93fd97a860eb88e26d4ea/2026-06/RUCO_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬囡囡小豬比的睡床只有一個咕臣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15e6035c0143b492db33ecbcd50c9cfd/2026-06/RUCO_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬早前在IG分享影片，帶女兒小豬比出海玩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e91921b5f2a417739dd5cb6df90b9cf/2026-06/RUCO_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬女兒小豬比站在直立板上，平衡感十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7adac211352f349b7087c8fa84d36648/2026-06/RUCO_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬囡囡小豬比左右划水，動作流暢，玩得非常開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7eac26c32deb744de96bd456a4b5809d/2026-06/RUCO_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬親手打造愛巢，包括木工、水電、拆卸、搬運到組裝傢俬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/87edd17c32f12dc5b87bacb79e67309c/2026-04/VS----2_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬將舊魚池改造成植物區。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53246068df10bc2a76cbe8543c92e6b5/2026-04/VS----2_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬親自當上花王，打理植物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/974368640e5c2b0486c7aa989e52e543/2026-04/VS----2_42_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"窗外種有大樹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/53ecdba42e2b85e5a5fafe9880780e17/2026-04/VS----2_49_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大花園特別為女兒設計，可以玩餐飽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd59ed3e852e02ba4468ec298fe05935/2026-04/VS----0_19_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔示範用智能門鎖。非常方便。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d880285c5705a7a61cacf1861887b712/2026-03/VS--1Instagram-0_05__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔表示家門外，有24小時智能監控。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b191b31e62f60cf8b6366c94a4f1b93e/2026-03/VS--1Instagram-0_17__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬承認搬新居。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/47c5ad25182087550e27ef373e6a6da7/2026-04/VS----0_15__1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬的複式單位，樓底甚高，寬敞舒適。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/001ac557bf0dbaa57034220cb67b152f/2026-04/VS----0_01__3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單位採光度甚佳，充滿暖暖的自然光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/982f9aec78ad5fee1a026bae64654d4c/2026-04/VS----0_03__2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"室內的每件小擺設，也充滿幸福感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35d69ca5004f2ccc382b6b90bf3111d2/2026-04/VS----0_09__3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬的複式單位，有著巨型落地玻璃窗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/187e2c7da097de0e2ade2b73dc0a4a2f/2026-04/VS----0_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"客廳寬敞舒適，空間感十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b9755fe188a62e849b21c376ab82a82/2026-04/VS----0_41_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"全屋以白色為主，連小家電也要襯色。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5fd69b61c2510f8f9c0605ce3a869f74/2026-04/VS----0_45_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"落地玻璃可看到室外的植物區，而且採光度十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95cc9464d6cf9de50efc604adbeb398f/2026-04/VS----0_53_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬透露曾為傢俬的尺寸，跟老婆單文柔有小磨擦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d077411b4f448a4d91bdcd23950ccf76/2026-04/VS----2_06_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"室內裝潢簡潔舒適。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e911614fe2fcb23c2236cdc4cafee14e/2026-04/VS----1_00_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬的複式單位，以純白及淺木色為主調。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/da841e950b507db55ccdf33c5cd1147b/2026-04/VS----1_02_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔為老公在家中設置一個獎項陳列櫃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2602af792141c2eb1e7ba5806f68cb67/2026-04/VS----4_09_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔新居廚房，寬敞整潔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb8915087252ae02b68058f2e0d7b86d/2026-03/VS--1Instagram-0_51_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>網民洗版式讚陳展鵬人品</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，陳展鵬的人品隨即引發熱烈迴響，網民紛紛洗版狂讚「煎pan真係好好」、「展鵬有義氣又孝順」。更有網民心痛又佩服地留言：「女細老婆嫩，2021年當時佢仲要用大量金錢醫治佢媽媽，獨子仲要有自己家庭負擔咁大情況下，竟然仲主動提出分五年歸還比對方，真心想知道當時娛樂圈疫情下會有幾多人似佢咁偉大？」亦有網民指他在法理之外為求問心無愧「還咗自己舒服啲」，再次贏得全網掌聲。</p>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬與單文柔早前搬到複式單位。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/72e1ac4ffd74956fbb279801fb7906e7/2026-05/raco_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬與單文柔育有一女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5db723b64f1b3dad1c23cb5628f960c6/2026-05/raco_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬與單文柔當年到英法影婚紗照。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0afa9dc140721309f55d24e3ffeff878/2023-03/aPANG_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬與單文柔於2018年結婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/92a8c5d3e1bfe65fa0d959993af5c2ab/2024-10/phoebe_30_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔於2019年為陳展鵬誕下一女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/33f8bc47cc4bab19f1fc4fb1d7af5447/2023-03/aPANG_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬與單文柔育有一女「小豬比」陳諾瑤（Quinta）。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/34b9b81160eac0765c20ce6daec413ce/2024-10/phoebe_22_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬為囡囡小豬比舉行百日宴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/325602ccc62cb9938573efc57ca2cb99/2023-03/aPANG_03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比6個月大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d0ad89ae122b60c9fd296244a2b8b36/2023-03/aPANG_04.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比兩歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e11d7faa03a1708e49884cc0958a0818/2023-03/aPANG_09.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬自成為人父後，更加顧家。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/efe210f0b0d300c62c2d4110cda9c7bd/2023-03/rucochan_323499328_719151689720927_7754252477892133652_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬不時晒出愛女小豬比的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d2fed28ce7eb372e15a94e8e07f3b0d/2023-06/smyphoebe_354237790_2259571410901899_168695509736496328_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬、單文柔帶與囡囡小豬比早前更齊齊上節目。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e7ca3836ad4a924ed996d7db2ce68eef/2023-09/01_0_22.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比越大越識擺Pose。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/abd9c418120b04fb6bd9d902cb5d72d1/2023-03/aPANG_14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比就讀星二代學府國際英文幼稚園暨幼兒園，N班每年學費逾8萬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c4d300790bb308fc958e2266d6a9ad37/2023-03/aPANG_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬看着女兒成長，有百般滋味。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe69968b6d2e4ab9809f62170479230a/2023-06/rucochan_350379671_3569296583305881_3656270549682523503_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比4歲生日會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f04d248f5790ff0e0eed3f1598c55be8/2024-03/smyphoebe_337730577_902757247618130_8983870658779111290_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比早前同媽咪去打高爾夫球。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a4b4ff3eaf75422760188ed906c70b6c/2023-04/PANG_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民都讚小豬比好得意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8a4f9b9e462b8dc6c1137b655737990d/2023-04/PANG_06.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比好好學，跟媽咪插花。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8d9e0aedee306daf96023558020788ff/2023-06/smyphoebe_348254399_1678641772561596_1155743514780079092_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比遺傳父母的表演天份。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b0a99947bd63d31a5bac3f322d85f8d/2024-03/smyphoebe_414187404_887119813265890_8629481432913178583_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比表情多多，是家中的開心果。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2a408b7e77d865599b5184db442da3c2/2024-03/smyphoebe_363796681_249389017930133_4785830359827067397_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"一家郊遊到有水的地方都沒有穿泳裝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44a538abc3d474b0b3d976d2476bc3fa/2024-02/smyphoebe_1689471000_3147549404651955926_2790249.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔出海都只穿小背心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ad56d8b4fa3564ec5aac4cbdf3c1092f/2024-02/smyphoebe_1692360749_3172074330360394232_2790249.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小豬比扮爸爸在《逆天奇案2》的揸槍動作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f2f87de065805588893d132a4fefea63/2024-06/rucochan_1716512367_3374672789716750160_832811.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬與單文柔去年為囡囡小豬比舉行5歲生日會。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c532441d27a756dffee4f811a108108a/2024-03/xiaozhubishengrikuaile_3_chenzhanpeng-haopengyoudabenying_laizixiaohongshuwangyeban.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬曾一家三口「港車北上」去樂園玩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a003633ed660f9ed415af91900d8ed1/2024-04/VS--vlog--0_59_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬非常愛錫妻女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b7d66612c832d661d0ad211bea6f3526/2022-12/Phoebe%20%2819%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單文柔不時分享與囡囡的日常。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0a2f4ac300792e176429fa17a39c338d/2022-12/Phoebe%20%2815%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"陳展鵬分享愛女萌爆食相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/709b6919bd01f3c26c3e0c0f06b3c243/2023-03/VideoScreenshot--Instagram-0%E2%80%9907%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-03T05:24:00.571651+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":632,"images":64,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}